</section>

<div class="console-section-heading"><div><p class="console-eyebrow">Your investigation desk</p><h2>Find the right way in.</h2></div><p>Six tools. One connected story.</p></div>
<div class="console-tool-grid">
    <section class="console-tool-card console-tool-violet">
        <div class="console-card-top"><span class="console-tool-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17 28H6V4h20v12M11 10h10M11 15h6"/><circle cx="23" cy="23" r="5"/><path d="m27 27 3 3"/></svg></span><span class="console-tool-category">Recorded context</span></div>
        <h2>Follow the audit trail</h2>
        <p>Find recorded changes by actor, tenant, stream, or correlation. Inspect the stored event and the context that came with it.</p>
        <a href="/audit" class="console-card-link">Open audit explorer <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </section>
    <section class="console-tool-card console-tool-lime">
        <div class="console-card-top"><span class="console-tool-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="6" width="10" height="20" rx="2"/><rect x="19" y="6" width="10" height="20" rx="2"/><path d="M7 12h2M7 17h2m14-5h2m-2 5h2m-10-1h6m-3-3 3 3-3 3"/></svg></span><span class="console-tool-category">Past &amp; present</span></div>
        <h2>Compare an order's past</h2>
        <p>Reconstruct two recorded versions. Compare the items, address, total, and status without changing live data.</p>
        <a href="/order-history" class="console-card-link">Open order replay lab <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </section>
    <section class="console-tool-card console-tool-ivory">
        <div class="console-card-top"><span class="console-tool-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11 7h17M11 16h17M11 25h17M5 9v5m0 4v5"/><circle cx="5" cy="7" r="2"/><circle cx="5" cy="16" r="2"/><circle cx="5" cy="25" r="2"/></svg></span><span class="console-tool-category">Step by step</span></div>
        <h2>Inspect an event stream</h2>
        <p>Read an aggregate's events in order. Inspect interpreted payloads and reveal actor and correlation metadata.</p>
        <a href="/streams" class="console-card-link">Open event browser <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </section>
    <section class="console-tool-card console-tool-peach">
        <div class="console-card-top"><span class="console-tool-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="12" width="8" height="8" rx="2"/><rect x="22" y="3" width="8" height="8" rx="2"/><rect x="22" y="22" width="8" height="8" rx="2"/><path d="M10 16h6V7h6m-6 9v10h6"/></svg></span><span class="console-tool-category">The bigger picture</span></div>
        <h2>Trace a workflow</h2>
        @if (Availability.IsAvailable)
        {
            <p>Follow one correlation ID across aggregate and process-manager streams, with tenant boundaries visible.</p>
            <a href="/correlations" class="console-card-link">Open correlation tracer <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        }
        else
        {
            <p>@Availability.UnavailableReason</p>
            <a href="/correlations" class="console-card-link">Check tracing availability <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        }
    </section>
    <section class="console-tool-card console-tool-ivory">
        <div class="console-card-top"><span class="console-tool-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 28h25M8 23v-8m8 8V5m8 18V10"/><circle cx="8" cy="12" r="2"/><circle cx="24" cy="7" r="2"/></svg></span><span class="console-tool-category">Read-side progress</span></div>
        <h2>Check projection status</h2>
        <p>Compare each checkpoint with the event-store head. See where a view trails a change that is already committed.</p>
        <a href="/projections" class="console-card-link">View projection status <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </section>
    <section class="console-tool-card console-tool-lavender">
        <div class="console-card-top"><span class="console-tool-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M27 11A12 12 0 0 0 7 7l-4 4m0-8v8h8m-6 10a12 12 0 0 0 20 4l4-4m0 8v-8h-8"/></svg></span><span class="console-tool-category">Recovery action</span></div>
        <h2>Rebuild order throughput</h2>
        <p>Reset and rebuild one tenant's activity view from its events. Review the target and confirm before the rebuild starts.</p>
        <a href="/replay" class="console-card-link">Review rebuild options <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </section>
</div>

<section class="console-demo-path" aria-labelledby="demo-route-heading">
    <div class="console-demo-intro"><p class="console-eyebrow">Put it together</p><h2 id="demo-route-heading">One order.<br />The whole story.</h2><p>A practical route through the console.</p></div>
    <ol>
        <li><span class="console-step-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span><div><h3>Make a business change</h3><p>Place an order in the business site, then cancel it while cancellation is allowed.</p></div></li>
        <li><span class="console-step-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span><div><h3>Explain the result</h3><p>Find the order stream, compare its placed and cancelled states, then follow the audit trail and cancellation correlation.</p></div></li>
        <li><span class="console-step-number" aria-hidden="true">03</span><div><h3>See the read side catch up</h3><p>Check projection progress. The rebuild tool demonstrates recovery of one tenant's activity view and requires confirmation.</p></div></li>
    </ol>
</section>
